OL,3,ATrump says suspension of Russia
OL,4,Asanctions is to keep peace negotiations
OL,5,Agoing
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump has said his
OL,8,Fdecision to suspend several Russian
OL,9,Fsanctions is an effort to keep Moscow
OL,10,Fat the negotiating table.
OL,12,F"I am in the process of negotiating
OL,13,FPeace in the war between Russia and
OL,14,FUkraine," Trump said on his Truth
OL,15,FSocial messaging platform, adding that
OL,16,Fhe didn't want to "do anything that
OL,17,Fwill drive, foolishly, Russia away from
OL,18,Fthe bargaining table".
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
