OL,3,AEU tariffs aimed at China hitting
OL,4,AUkraine, steel boss says
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said he wished to see "at least a
OL,7,Fcarve out" for Ukraine to access the EU
OL,8,Fmarket.
OL,10,FA spokesperson for the European
OL,11,FCommission said the EU "took into
OL,12,Faccount the difficult situation" of
OL,13,FUkraine when deciding its steel policy.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
